 "caption": "State holidays; fourth Friday in November as National Sugarcane Syrup Day; designate",
 "summary": "A BILL to be entitled an Act to amend Chapter 4 of Title 1 of the Official Code of Georgia Annotated, relating to holidays and observances, so as to designate the fourth Friday in November of each year as \"National Sugarcane Syrup Day\" in Georgia; to provide legislative findings and declarations; to provide for related matters; to repeal conflicting laws; and for other purposes.",
